# lang-python — Python developer toolchain (FETCHED-ONLINE, never baked). `uv`
# (the fast installer/resolver) is already in the baked dev baseline
# (packages/goodies.list), so this pack adds the per-application installer and the
# linter/formatter, plus an OPT-IN `mise:python` runtime directive for a
# mise-managed interpreter alongside the system python. All members are
# official-repo. `iictl pack remove lang-python` undoes the directive and -Rns's
# the members.
#meta:type lang
python-pipx
ruff

# Opt-in mise-managed Python runtime (engine runs `mise use -g python`; inverse
# on remove). uv stays the primary project tool; mise is for whole-interpreter
# version management for users who want it.
mise:python
